# Borealis Linux — core package list (installed into the image).
# Every line here must exist in Debian 12 bookworm (main/contrib/non-free/
# non-free-firmware). build.sh pre-flights this list and aborts early on a
# missing package. Packages with any availability doubt go into
# borealis-optional.list.chroot.template instead.

##### Kernel / platform (kernel upgraded to 6.12 LTS by hook 0100) #####
linux-image-amd64
intel-microcode
amd64-microcode
memtest86+

##### Firmware — wide 2008–2026 hardware coverage #####
firmware-linux
firmware-linux-nonfree
firmware-misc-nonfree
firmware-amd-graphics
firmware-iwlwifi
firmware-atheros
firmware-brcm80211
firmware-realtek
firmware-sof-signed
bluez-firmware
# note: bookworm ships MediaTek blobs inside firmware-misc-nonfree;
# the standalone firmware-mediatek package only exists from trixie on.

##### Borealis Shell (Wayland desktop) — no XFCE, no LXQt, ever #####
wayfire
waybar
foot
sway-notification-center
swaybg
swaylock
swayidle
grim
slurp
wl-clipboard
xwayland
qtwayland5
lightdm
lightdm-gtk-greeter
accountsservice
policykit-1
policykit-1-gnome

##### XDG / portals #####
xdg-desktop-portal
xdg-desktop-portal-wlr
xdg-desktop-portal-gtk
xdg-user-dirs
xdg-utils
shared-mime-info

